<title>USA: USDA daily cattle and hog slaughter - July 24.</title>
<headline>USDA daily cattle and hog slaughter - July 24.</headline>
<text>
<p>Est daily livestock slaughter under Fed inspection - USDA</p>
<p>					  Cattle	 Calves    Hogs</p>
<p>Thursday   07/24/97  (est)	130,000	5,000     328,000</p>
<p>Week ago (est)			128,000	5,000     341,000</p>
<p>Year ago (act)			132,000	6,000     318,000</p>
<p>Week to date (est)		  514,000     21,000   1,282,000</p>
<p>Same Period Last Week (est)     518,000     22,000   1,307,000</p>
<p>Same Period Last Year (act)     521,000     28,000   1,275,000</p>
<p>Previous Day Estimated	Steer and Heifer	Cow and Bull</p>
<p>Wednesday			     105,000		     23,000</p>
<p>*USDA revised Wednesday (7/23/97) Cattle Slaughter to 128,000 head from 132,000.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
